    - Term: DailyChallenges/ShareInvitation
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Can you complete it too? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - هل يمكنك إكماله أيضًا؟ #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Можеш ли и ти да го завършиш? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - 你也能完成吗？ #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Dokážeš to dokončit také? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Kun jij het ook voltooien? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Peux-tu aussi le terminer ? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Kannst du es auch schaffen? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Μπορείς να το ολοκληρώσεις κι εσύ; #eyesthehorrorgame
      - क्या तुम भी इसे पूरा कर सकते हो? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Te is teljesíteni tudod? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Bisakah kamu menyelesaikannya juga? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Riesci a completarlo anche tu? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - あなたも クリアで きる？ #eyesthehorrorgame
      - តើ អ្នក អាច បញ្ចប់ វា ដែរ ឬទេ? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - 당신도 완료할 수 있나요? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Ar ir tu gali tai įveikti? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Bolehkah anda menyelesaikannya juga? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Klarer du også å fullføre det? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - تو هم می‌توانی آن را کامل کنی؟ #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Też dasz radę to ukończyć? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Você também consegue concluir? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Poți să-l termini și tu? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Сможешь тоже пройти это? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Dokážeš to dokončiť aj ty? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - ¿Puedes completarlo tú también? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Kan du också klara det? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - คุณทำสำเร็จได้เหมือนกันไหม? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Sen de tamamlayabilir misin? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Kaya mo rin bang tapusin ito? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Зможеш також це пройти? #eyesthehorrorgame
      - Bạn cũng có thể hoàn thành chứ? #eyesthehorrorgame
