    - Term: news_2026_07_29_flashlight_body
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - The long-awaited flashlight has been added at the request of our players. Remember that you can adjust the game's brightness in the settings during gameplay to customize your horror experience.
      - تريد. اللعب لتخصيص تجربة الرعب كما سطوع اللعبة من الإعدادات أثناء لاعبينا. تذكّر أنه يمكنك ضبط طال انتظاره بناءً على طلب تمت إضافة المصباح اليدوي الذي
      - Дългоочакваното фенерче беше добавено по молба на нашите играчи. Не забравяй, че по време на игра можеш да регулираш яркостта от настройките, за да персонализираш хорър изживяването си.
      - 应玩家们的要求， 期待已久的手电 筒已经更新。 请记住， 游戏过程中你可 以在设置里更改 游戏亮度以调整 恐怖体验
      - Dlouho očekávaná svítilna byla přidána na žádost našich hráčů. Nezapomeň, že během hry můžeš v nastavení upravit jas a přizpůsobit si tak hororový zážitek.
      - De langverwachte zaklamp is op verzoek van onze spelers toegevoegd. Vergeet niet dat je tijdens het spelen de helderheid van het spel in de instellingen kunt aanpassen om je horrorervaring naar wens af te stemmen.
      - La lampe torche tant attendue a enfin été ajoutée à la demande de nos joueurs. N’oubliez pas que vous pouvez régler la luminosité du jeu dans les paramètres pendant une partie afin de personnaliser votre expérience horrifique.
      - Die lang erwartete Taschenlampe wurde auf Wunsch unserer Spieler hinzugefügt. Denk daran, dass du während des Spiels in den Einstellungen die Helligkeit anpassen kannst, um dein Horror-Erlebnis individuell einzustellen.
      - Ο πολυαναμενόμενος φακός προστέθηκε έπειτα από αίτημα των παικτών μας. Θυμήσου ότι μπορείς να ρυθμίσεις τη φωτεινότητα του παιχνιδιού στις ρυθμίσεις κατά τη διάρκεια του παιχνιδιού, ώστε να προσαρμόσεις την εμπειρία τρόμου.
      - हमारे खिलाड़ियों के अनुरोध पर लंबे समय से इंतज़ार की जा रही टॉर्च जोड़ दी गई है। याद रखें, खेलते समय आप सेटिंग्स में गेम की ब्राइटनेस बदलकर अपने हॉरर अनुभव को अपने हिसाब से सेट कर सकते हैं।
      - A játékosaink kérésére bekerült a régóta várt zseblámpa. Ne feledd, játék közben a beállításokban módosíthatod a fényerőt, hogy saját ízlésedre szabd a horrorélményt.
      - Senter yang telah lama ditunggu kini ditambahkan atas permintaan pemain kami. Ingat, kamu dapat mengatur kecerahan game di pengaturan saat bermain untuk menyesuaikan pengalaman horormu.
      - La torcia tanto attesa è stata aggiunta su richiesta dei nostri giocatori. Ricorda che durante il gioco puoi regolare la luminosità nelle impostazioni per personalizzare la tua esperienza horror.
      - プレイヤーの皆さ んからの要望に 応え、 待望の懐中電灯を 追加しました。 ゲーム中は 設定から明るさを 調整して、 お好みのホラー体 験に カスタマイズで きます。
      - ភ្លើងពិលដែលអ្នកលេងរង់ចាំយូរត្រូវបានបន្ថែមតាមសំណើរបស់អ្នកលេង។ ចងចាំថាអ្នកអាចកែពន្លឺក្នុងការកំណត់ពេលកំពុងលេង ដើម្បីកំណត់បទពិសោធន៍ភ័យខ្លាចតាមចិត្ត។
      - The long-awaited flashlight has been added at the request of our players. Remember that you can adjust the game's brightness in the settings during gameplay to customize your horror experience.
      - The long-awaited flashlight has been added at the request of our players. Remember that you can adjust the game's brightness in the settings during gameplay to customize your horror experience.
      - Lampu suluh yang dinanti-nantikan telah ditambah atas permintaan pemain kami. Ingat, anda boleh melaraskan kecerahan permainan dalam tetapan semasa bermain untuk menyesuaikan pengalaman seram anda.
      - The long-awaited flashlight has been added at the request of our players. Remember that you can adjust the game's brightness in the settings during gameplay to customize your horror experience.
      - The long-awaited flashlight has been added at the request of our players. Remember that you can adjust the game's brightness in the settings during gameplay to customize your horror experience.
      - The long-awaited flashlight has been added at the request of our players. Remember that you can adjust the game's brightness in the settings during gameplay to customize your horror experience.
      - The long-awaited flashlight has been added at the request of our players. Remember that you can adjust the game's brightness in the settings during gameplay to customize your horror experience.
      - The long-awaited flashlight has been added at the request of our players. Remember that you can adjust the game's brightness in the settings during gameplay to customize your horror experience.
      - По просьбам игроков мы добавили долгожданный фонарик. Помните, что во время игры можно настроить яркость в параметрах и подобрать нужную атмосферу ужаса.
      - The long-awaited flashlight has been added at the request of our players. Remember that you can adjust the game's brightness in the settings during gameplay to customize your horror experience.
